# The counted loops of at most four passes are fully unrolled: each becomes
# straight-line code or a return (a rolled loop keeps its phi, test, branch
# and step).  The loops the course solution keeps rolled are not bounded
# here; the regression lane pins them.
instructions <= 8 in @unroll_four
instructions <= 4 in @unroll_decrement
instructions <= 4 in @unroll_inverted_exit
instructions <= 4 in @unroll_unsigned
instructions <= 4 in @unroll_zero_trip
